{
  "sn11.18:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 11.18 ",
  "sn11.18:0.2": "2. Dutiyavagga ",
  "sn11.18:0.3": "Gahaṭṭhavandanāsutta ",
  "sn11.18:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ. ",
  "sn11.18:1.2": "Tatra …pe… etadavoca: ",
  "sn11.18:1.3": "“bhūtapubbaṁ, bhikkhave, sakko devānamindo mātaliṁ saṅgāhakaṁ āmantesi: ",
  "sn11.18:1.4": "‘yojehi, samma mātali, sahassayuttaṁ ājaññarathaṁ. Uyyānabhūmiṁ gacchāma subhūmiṁ dassanāyā’ti. ",
  "sn11.18:1.5": "‘Evaṁ, bhaddantavā’ti kho, bhikkhave, mātali saṅgāhako sakkassa devānamindassa paṭissutvā sahassayuttaṁ ājaññarathaṁ yojetvā sakkassa devānamindassa paṭivedesi: ",
  "sn11.18:1.6": "‘yutto kho te, mārisa, sahassayutto ājaññaratho. ",
  "sn11.18:1.7": "Yassadāni kālaṁ maññasī’ti. ",
  "sn11.18:1.8": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, sakko devānamindo vejayantapāsādā orohanto añjaliṁ katvā sudaṁ puthuddisā namassati. ",
  "sn11.18:1.9": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, mātali saṅgāhako sakkaṁ devānamindaṁ gāthāya ajjhabhāsi: ",
  "sn11.18:2.1": "‘Taṁ namassanti tevijjā, ",
  "sn11.18:2.2": "sabbe bhummā ca khattiyā; ",
  "sn11.18:2.3": "Cattāro ca mahārājā, ",
  "sn11.18:2.4": "tidasā ca yasassino; ",
  "sn11.18:2.5": "Atha ko nāma so yakkho, ",
  "sn11.18:2.6": "yaṁ tvaṁ sakka namassasī’ti. ",
  "sn11.18:3.1": "‘Maṁ namassanti tevijjā, ",
  "sn11.18:3.2": "sabbe bhummā ca khattiyā; ",
  "sn11.18:3.3": "Cattāro ca mahārājā, ",
  "sn11.18:3.4": "tidasā ca yasassino. ",
  